<p class="isSelectedEnd">Built-in shelving, media units, cupboards, and window seats are designed specifically for your room. This is especially useful in London homes, where chimney breasts, alcoves, and unusual layouts often make standard furniture difficult to use effectively.</p>
<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/custom-furniture-design/">Bespoke joinery</a></strong> also helps reduce clutter by integrating storage into the architecture of the room rather than adding more standalone furniture. To gauge specific carpentry investments, review our guide on <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/how-much-does-bespoke-joinery-cost-in-london-in-2026/">how much bespoke joinery costs in London</a>, or see how storage planning is handled in our bedroom guide on <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/how-much-storage-should-you-plan-for-in-a-london-bedroom/">how much storage to plan for in a London bedroom</a>.</p>
